   "file": "Projects/Web Scraping/database-architecture.md",
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "9805b332432bf122",
   "type": "file",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 740,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 130,
   "file": "Resources/model-log.md",
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "d4711c5d8d88253e",
   "type": "group",
   "x": 520,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 560,
   "label": "2. SOURCES (competitor sites)",
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "7dabaf0ed04eb839",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 550,
   "y": 60,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 170,
   "text": "## Apex Footwear\napexfootwearltd.com\n**FIRST TARGET (pilot).** Leather-focused. robots.txt: 404 = no rules published, terms still to check.",
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "1ebbc0cee5768c08",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 550,
   "y": 270,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 120,
   "text": "## Later, one at a time\nBay, Jennys, then others. Each passes a quick check first: leather-heavy? online catalogue?",
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "811d283493659e1d",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 550,
   "y": 430,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 100,
   "text": "## Bata (parked)\nToo big, too much non-leather. Revisit leather categories only.",
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "9f5d6d540e43c663",
   "type": "group",
   "x": 1040,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 460,
   "height": 1260,
   "label": "3. SCRAPER (5 Python scripts + 2 manual checks)",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "97ca4d3ad8eda6f2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1070,
   "y": 60,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 130,
   "text": "**Manual: permission check**\nrobots.txt, terms, official API. Blocked = STOP, no evasion. (DONE for Apex)",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "a80bef4797b84986",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1070,
   "y": 230,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 130,
   "text": "**Manual: recon (read only)**\nHow data loads, product fields, screenshots. (DONE for Apex)",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "05faa6cd78fd0b7c",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1070,
   "y": 400,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 130,
   "text": "**Script 1: apex_urls.py** (DONE)\nSitemap -> URL list. Skips obvious non-leather by URL name. 1 request.",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "cffea875d74037c3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1070,
   "y": 570,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 130,
   "text": "**Script 2: apex_fetch.py**\nVisit each page, 1 to 1.5 s gap, retries, resumable, stops on a block. Saves raw data.",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "16138360bb16e89a",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1070,
   "y": 740,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 130,
   "text": "**Script 3: apex_clean.py**\nLeather filter on the Material field. Tidy price/sizes. Unclear goes to check.csv.",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "4d24af1ca929f3c2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1070,
   "y": 910,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 130,
   "text": "**Script 4: apex_photos.py**\nPhotos for kept leather items only, resized, named by product id, sha256.",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "ef2116ff49817feb",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1070,
   "y": 1080,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 130,
   "text": "**Script 5: apex_load_db.py**\nLoad products, photos, price snapshot into market.db, then run the check script.",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "02eb7a64264d740e",
   "type": "group",
   "x": 1600,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 460,
   "height": 900,
   "label": "4. STORAGE (files)",
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "eb9561ee4512de9f",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1630,
   "y": 60,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "## data/apex/products.jsonl\nRAW, append-only, never edited. The backup. Watch it grow live in VS Code.",
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "7b880e7a7261a31c",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1630,
   "y": 250,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 170,
   "text": "## market.db (SQLite)\nsites, products, product_photos, price_snapshots. Rebuildable from the raw file.",
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "1489951c1a189d15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1630,
   "y": 460,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "## data/photos/apex/<product_id>/\nPhoto files. The database only stores their paths.",
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "276b742710a71d00",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1630,
   "y": 650,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 130,
   "text": "## check.csv\nItems where leather is unclear. You decide by hand.",
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "2eb82109a4580e79",
   "type": "group",
   "x": 2160,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 460,
   "height": 1000,
   "label": "5. USE (what you get)",
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "49a017ad42a77c54",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2190,
   "y": 60,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 230,
   "text": "## Market lookup\nYou send a photo or description.\nI extract attributes, query the database, return low / median / high price, comparable photos, sources, confidence.",
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "642d27bf08affc62",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2190,
   "y": 330,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "## Viewing\nRainbow CSV in VS Code (live), Google Sheets for sorting, SQLite viewer extension.",
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "8806027a7e73e047",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2190,
   "y": 520,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 180,
   "text": "## Blue upload (LATER)\nWhen you upload a shoe on the Blue page, the lookup runs first and gives a price package. Same site, shared admin with Fable.",
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "ff3b87ce9acccea3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2190,
   "y": 740,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 130,
   "text": "## Notes + canvases\nPer-site architecture note, product-grouped canvas with photos, screenshots.",
   "color": "4"
  }
 ],
